# Whitelist: ignore everything, then re-include the durable "Claude brain".
# Secrets (.secrets.env, keys/, .credentials.json), transcripts, file-history,
# and caches are excluded by the catch-all and never re-included.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
# SOUL.md is the top rung of the meditation promotion ladder and the only file
# /meditate may edit autonomously (2026-08-12). Tracked so every self-edit has a
# diff and a revert path. Untracked, a bad night was unrecoverable.
!/SOUL.md
!/RTK.md
!/settings.json
!/keybindings.json
# The $BASH_ENV loader itself, NOT the secrets it reads. It holds no values —
# only the code that sources .secrets.env (still excluded, below). Tracked
# because settings.json points at it and it carries the
# CLAUDE_HEADLESS_MEDITATION guard, which a rebuild would otherwise lose.
!/load-secrets.sh
!/agents
!/hooks
# Git hooks (core.hooksPath points here). Lived in ~/.git-hooks until
# 2026-08-11, which was version controlled nowhere — a single unbacked-up file
# gating every commit on the machine.
!/git-hooks
# Per-session Fable-spawn counter (agent-model-guard state) — churns every
# session, no history value.
hooks/.fable-spawn-counts.json
!/skills
!/skills-archive
!/docs
# Harness tools that live on this machine (deskclaw, 2026-08-12). Default-DENY
# inside each tool, mirroring the projects/ idiom above. A tool that reads the
# screen writes screenshots, an audit log and a STOP flag; naming those dirs to
# exclude them would track any future runtime dir (shots/, logs/, cache/) by
# accident. Source files are re-included by extension instead.
!/tools
tools/*/*
!tools/*/lib/
!tools/*/tests/
!tools/*/*.ps1
!tools/*/*.md
# .cjs (2026-08-13): same silent-ignore trap as ears.py below — prove.cjs and
# fleet.cjs were skipped by the default-deny while their READMEs staged fine.
!tools/*/*.cjs
!tools/*/*.txt
!tools/*/.gitignore
!tools/*/desk
# .py + the ears wrapper (2026-08-13): the extract commit shipped README and
# tests but the tool itself was silently ignored — ears.py never got tracked.
!tools/*/*.py
!tools/*/ears
!/scripts
!/meditations
!/commands
!/workflows
!/projects
projects/*/*
!projects/*/memory

# Belt and braces: even if re-included above by mistake, never these
.secrets.env
keys/
.credentials.json
*.pem
*.key

# Memory files containing sk- shaped strings (found 2026-07-10 scan) - keep local only
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/project_arch_review_2026_07_03_decision_queue.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/project_guard_deadline_noise_shipped_2026_07_02.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/project_june_deferral_triage_shipped_2026_07_02.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/project_policy_tuning_loop_shipped_2026_07_01.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/project_risk_observability_shipped_2026_07_02.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/project_security_review_2026_07_05_open_items.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/project_work_orders_build_in_progress.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/reference_dashclaw_risk_calibration_suite.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/reference_dashclaw_runaway_loop_policy.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/reference_guard_risk_blend_and_operator_approval.md
projects/C--Projects-DashClaw/memory/reference_local_ci_replica_gotchas.md
projects/C--Users-sandm-clawd/memory/task-grade-adapter-build.md

# --- runtime + secrets hardening (2026-07-11, impact-roadmap session) ---
# Script runtime output and state churn every poll; .env files carry live keys.
scripts/*/.env
scripts/*/out/
scripts/*/run.log
scripts/*/state.json
scripts/*/history.jsonl
scripts/**/__pycache__/
scripts/*/.dashclaw-local/
scripts/*/.offlocal/
scripts/fleet-briefing/%SystemDrive%/
telemetry/
scripts/harness-audit/reports/
scripts/harness-audit/last-audit-output.txt
